@startuml
title BLPS Lab3 - System Context

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor Landlord
actor Tenant
actor Admin

rectangle "BLPS Lab3 Platform" as System {
  rectangle "Claim Processing System" as Core
}

Landlord --> Core : create claim\nsend additional info
Tenant --> Core : send tenant response
Admin --> Core : make support decision\ndeactivate user

Core --> Landlord : eventual claim status\nand notifications
Core --> Tenant : eventual claim status\nand notifications
Core --> Admin : audit trail\nand operational visibility

note right of Core
  Event-driven microservice system
  with:
  - database per service
  - Kafka integration
  - Saga choreography
  - Transactional Outbox
  - eventual consistency
end note

@enduml
